Warning	4040	Limit of 32 on JSON nested structures depth is reached in argument 1 to function 'json_contains_path' at position 32
SELECT JSON_OVERLAPS(@d32, '[1]') AS over_limit;
over_limit
0
Warnings:
Warning	4040	Limit of 32 on JSON nested structures depth is reached in argument 1 to function 'json_overlaps' at position 33
SELECT JSON_EQUALS(@d32, @d32) AS over_limit;
over_limit
